    "name":  "Kit - Solar LED Strip - For outdoor use - 5 meters - 2700K - IP66",
    "reference":  "SSP-WW-91799",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe\u003cstrong\u003e 5 METER Solar LED Strip\u003c/strong\u003e with Lithium battery is a revolutionary product that offers sustainable and high quality\u003cstrong\u003e outdoor lighting\u003c/strong\u003e. It combines the efficiency of \u003cstrong\u003esolar\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eenergy\u003c/strong\u003e with the versatility of state-of-the-art LED lighting, satisfying the most demanding needs.  It is ideal for illuminating and beautifying gardens and patios, as well as creating a cozy atmosphere on terraces and balconies.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, it is perfect for outdoor events and activities such as camping. It can also serve as security lighting and is a practical choice for illuminating boats and ships. Its use in DIY and craft projects allows you to unleash your creativity.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eKit - Solar LED Strip - For outdoor use - 5 meters - 2700K - IP66\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the wonder of the\u003cstrong\u003e Solar LED Strip\u003c/strong\u003e, the revolutionary product that will provide you with sustainable, high quality lighting for any outdoor environment! Designed to meet the most demanding needs, this solar strip light combines the efficiency of solar energy with the versatility of state-of-the-art LED lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the heart of this technological marvel is its powerful\u003cstrong\u003e 1.8W/5V solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e, which captures and converts sunlight into clean, renewable energy. Imagine the ability to enjoy beautiful lighting without having to worry about your electric bill or carbon footprint - it\u0027s a smart choice for your home and the environment!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe long-lasting battery, with a capacity of \u003cstrong\u003e1800mAH/3.2V,\u003c/strong\u003e ensures your nights are lit for hours. With an auto mode run time of up to \u003cstrong\u003e12 hours\u003c/strong\u003e, this solar LED strip gives you the freedom to enjoy your outdoor spaces without worrying about constantly recharging it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e2700K\u003c/strong\u003e color temperature provides a \u003cstrong\u003ewarm\u003c/strong\u003e and welcoming \u003cstrong\u003elight\u003c/strong\u003e, perfect for creating a relaxing and enchanting ambiance. Whether to enhance your garden, decorate your patio or illuminate your deck, this solar LED strip is suitable for any place and any occasion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts durable and sturdy design is another impressive feature. Made from premium materials, such as ABS and PVC, this LED strip is able to withstand inclement weather, from rain to wind and dust. Thanks to its\u003cstrong\u003e IP65 protection\u003c/strong\u003e rating, this solar LED strip is completely waterproof, making it ideal for outdoor use, regardless of weather conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, it is easy and quick to install. The \u003cstrong\u003e5 meter\u003c/strong\u003e long strip gives you enough flexibility to place it wherever you want. Whether it\u0027s for delineating pathways, illuminating steps or decorating your pergola, this solar LED strip is perfectly suited to your lighting needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBest of all, the Solar LED Strip features fast and efficient charging. With only 4-6 hours of exposure to 40000 lux of sunlight, the battery will fully recharge, giving you hours of uninterrupted light.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts rugged design and solar powered capability make it perfect for outdoor use, where it can provide practical and attractive lighting. Here are some ideas of where you can use this amazing product:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGardens and patios:\u003c/strong\u003e Solar LED Strip is ideal for illuminating and enhancing the beauty of your garden or patio. You can install it along pathways and walkways to create an enchanting ambiance during the evenings. You can also place it around sitting areas or near plants and flowers to add a magical touch to your outdoor space.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTerraces and balconies:\u003c/strong\u003e If you have a terrace or balcony, the Solar LED Strip can turn it into a cozy and relaxing space to enjoy evenings outdoors. You can place it on railings, columns or on the ceiling to illuminate the area and create a more intimate atmosphere.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDecorative lighting for outdoor events:\u003c/strong\u003e Solar LED Strip is perfect for outdoor events, such as parties, weddings, barbecues and family gatherings. You can use it to decorate tents, awnings or pergolas, creating a festive and cheerful atmosphere.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCamping and outdoor activities:\u003c/strong\u003e If you are a camping lover or enjoy outdoor activities, this solar LED strip is an excellent choice to light up your tent or resting area. It can also be useful for lighting up camping areas or trails at night.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSecurity Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e In addition to its decorative use, the Solar LED Strip can also serve as security lighting. You can install it around doors, windows or dark areas to provide additional illumination and deter potential intruders.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBoat and watercraft lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e If you have a boat or watercraft, Solar LED Strip can be an efficient and practical lighting solution to illuminate areas such as decks, gangways or stairs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDIY and craft projects:\u003c/strong\u003e This solar LED strip is ideal for DIY and craft projects. You can use it to create custom solar lamps, interior decoration or any other creative ideas you can think of.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDon\u0027t be left behind and be part of the solar lighting revolution with the Solar LED Strip. A perfect combination of innovative technology, functional design and commitment to the environment. Light up your life with sustainable energy and make the most of your outdoor spaces with this amazing solar LED strip, it\u0027s time to shine with solar light!\u003c/p\u003e",
